msgstr "%(imported)s transaksi diimpor, %(skipped)s sudah ada."

#. module: flousflow_accounting
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:flousflow_accounting.bsi__action_account_statement_import_map
msgid ""
"A map tells Odoo how to read the CSV or Excel file of one bank: its separators, the format\n"
"                    of its dates and which column holds the date, the label and the amount of a transaction.\n"
"                    Set the map on the journal of the bank and import the file as usual."
msgstr ""
"Pemetaan memberi tahu Odoo cara membaca file CSV atau Excel dari suatu bank: pemisahnya, format\n"
"                    tanggalnya, dan kolom mana yang berisi tanggal, label, dan jumlah transaksi.\n"
"                    Tetapkan pemetaan pada jurnal bank dan impor file seperti biasa."

